      "text": "Over 13 days, this route takes you through Peru’s main historical and natural regions: Lima, Cusco, the Sacred Valley of the Incas, Machu Picchu, Puno and Lake Titicaca, Colca Canyon, Arequipa, Nazca, Paracas and back to Lima.",
